            <ArticleTitle>Morbidity scoring after abdominal surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>453-458</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Postoperative monitoring of pain and distress in small rodents is not standardized, and widely accepted score sheets are not available. Here we describe a score sheet used in abdominal surgery of rodents, with particular reference to procedures involving the liver.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>© The Author(s) 2016.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
